# @preflight/schemas

## Imports

- `zod` + own files only.
- Never: `@preflight/rules`, `apps/*`.

Why: web imports schemas. If schemas pulls rules, client bundles matchers.

## Owns

- Wire DTOs (campaign, brief, asset, finding, rule catalog, waive/decide, rerun strip).
- `foldStatus(findings) → Status` — five-state order is contract (04-data-model.md).
- `ApiResponse<T>`.
- Rulebook write DTOs for judgement rules only.

## Does not own

- Matchers, predicates, agent prompts, `runDeterministic`.

## Types

- One resource per file. `fold-status.ts` and `api-response.ts` separate.
- DTOs via `z.infer` — no parallel interface for the same shape.

## Tests (mandatory when touched)

- `foldStatus`: five-state fold order tests.
- No DTO snapshot tests unless the task is snapshots.

## Signature (do not change)

`foldStatus(findings): Status` — order in 04 is the contract.
